    47	| Sampling frame | The candidate frame of public .NET repositories, window, draw, and eligibility rules frozen in section 6.1-6.3 (domain cells added by R3) **before** R2B′ inspects any task data. Every supply figure and every NOT FEASIBLE statement is scoped to that frame. |
