   477	## 8. Public record and evidence manifest
   478	
   479	### 8.1 Redacted public record
   480	
   481	All decision inputs in the public-proxy domain are public repository history,
   482	so there is no restricted evidence tier under v1. "Redacted" here means only
   483	what [r0-authorization.md](r0-authorization.md) section 7 already requires,
   484	which these rules adopt without change:
   485	
   486	- no contributor usernames, display names, or emails in any committed
   487	  artifact; emails are never extracted;
   488	- no per-item identifier (PR number, issue number, commit SHA) next to an
   489	  eligibility decision, exclusion, or cluster assignment; provenance is the
   490	  repository name, one pinned repository revision, the window, the pinned
   491	  extractor and rules version, and a SHA-256 digest of the full per-item
   492	  decision list, which is never committed and is deleted with local caches;
   493	- author clustering, if needed, uses in-memory ordinal pseudonyms only;
   494	- no published statistic over fewer than 5 distinct contributors;
   495	- no copied upstream source beyond what its license permits.
   496	
   497	If any non-public evidence becomes necessary, work stops; R0 permits no
   498	restricted access.
   499	
   500	### 8.2 Evidence manifest format
   501	
   502	Each R2B′/R4/R5 output ships an `evidence-manifest.jsonl` with one JSON object
   503	per **extraction or computation run** (never per item):
   504	
   505	| Field | Type | Meaning |
   506	|---|---|---|
   507	| `id` | string | Stable evidence ID, `ev-<gate>-<nnn>` |
   508	| `gate` | string | Producing gate (`R2B'`, `R4`, `R5`) and consuming rule component (for example `G3.1`) |
   509	| `rules_version` | string | `r1-decision-rules/v1` |
   510	| `repositories` | array | Repository names with one pinned revision each, or `frame` for frame-level enumeration |
   511	| `window` | string | ISO 8601 interval |
   512	| `extraction_spec_sha256` | string | Hash of the frozen query/filter specification |
   513	| `tool` | string | Extractor/computation code commit and runtime version |
   514	| `extracted_at` | string | ISO 8601 UTC timestamp |
   515	| `per_item_list_sha256` | string | Digest of the uncommitted per-item decision list (R0 section 7.1) |
   516	| `aggregate_path` | string | Path of the committed aggregate in this repository |
   517	| `aggregate_sha256` | string | Hash of that aggregate |
   518	| `access_class` | string | `public` (only value permitted) |
   519	| `licenses` | array | SPDX identifier per repository |
   520	| `status` | string | `valid`, `invalid`, or `superseded` |
   521	| `status_reason` | string | Required unless `valid` |
