   376	
   377	These are **proposed adoption thresholds**, not observed results or approved
   378	spend. The safety margin remains **+1 percentage point** in this revision.
   379	M0 may map alternatives, but cannot approve one. A changed margin requires
   380	a separate, written business-risk rationale, adopter acceptance, independent

