   539	Before calculating, register scenario ranges, methods, and the following
   540	output rules. Size the original 1-point margin first. Map margins
   541	{1, 2, 5, 10} points against review capacities {40, 80, 150, 300} triplets
   542	and inventoried or explicitly hypothetical task supplies. Larger margins
   543	are tradeoff illustrations, not acceptable risk by default. Record the
   544	adopter/owner's independently justified risk limit separately; absent
   545	approval, 1 point remains the only adoption claim.
