   547	For each row, show every gate's required sample/cost range, both positive
   548	decision scenarios, source-task limits, and assumptions about pairing,
   549	event rates, completion, cost variation, setup, and reviewer dependence.
   550	Compute available final n from **both** review capacity and independent
