   340	| Deadline passes before R5 is dispositioned, whatever the state of R1-R4 | `EXPIRED` | Invalidation rule below for every affected gate, including gates already `MET`; then the R5 administrative closeout. |
   341	
   342	**R5 administrative closeout.** This is the only work permitted when R0 is
   343	`EXPIRED` or `REVOKED`, or when a prerequisite of R5 is not `MET`. It is
   344	exempt from the revalidation stop above. It may only: record the terminal
   345	gate values, invalidations, and disposition actions; publish the dated reason
